"""
Corrected tension scores for the 17 Apocrypha books and Malachi (2026-10-24).

These books were originally scored against an earlier list of 20 tensions
(T07 = literal vs. allegorical, T15 = creation care, T16 = monotheism, ...), so
their scores sat on the wrong axes of the app's T01–T20. They were re-scored
against the app's definitions, reusing the old rationale wherever it fits an
axis (sign flipped where the old axis ran the other way).

Polarity reminders (-5 = pole A, +5 = pole B):
  T01 henotheism / monotheism        T02 universal / tribal exclusivism
  T07 death as oblivion / resurrection  T16 historical / mythological
  T18 individual / collective          T20 suffering redemptive / punishment

Applied by apply_tension_fixes.py; generate_apocrypha_seed.py also uses them.
"""

